    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You've dedicated your life to unraveling the secrets of the ancient Shory Empire, either through meticulous research or by traveling into dangerous and distant ruins to track down longlost artifacts.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Intelligence, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Crafting skill and the Shory Lore skill. You gain the Specialty Crafting skill feat."
